  {
   "type": "kpis",
   "title": "Customer Success Stories with ZOLLER",
   "subtitle": "Higher profits, more orders, less time spent, low production costs—ZOLLER boosts its customers’ efficiency worldwide.",
   "items": [
    {
     "label": "Gear Up at High Speed",
     "value": "30%",
     "text": "<p>By reducing this percentage, a ZOLLER »»hyperion«« reduces setup times at SycoTec. Turning tools and multi-tool holders are measured on the horizontal presetting and measuring machine. SycoTec uses these to manufacture high-speed micro-motors. </p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/company/reports-stories/details?tx_news_pi1%5Bnews%5D=116&amp;cHash=af4114be70126277ca6ed6d8f381beca\">Read the success story</a></p>"
    },
    {
     "label": "Lower personnel costs",
     "value": "83%",
     "text": "<p>This is the potential reduction in labor costs for tool inspection in a three-shift operation when you use the »»roboSet 2«« automation solution. </p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/products/automation/tool-inspection/roboset-2\">Learn more about »»roboSet 2««</a></p>"
    },
    {
     "label": "Quick Payback",
     "value": "9 months",
     "text": "<p>That’s the average time it takes for a presetting and measuring machine to pay for itself. Basis: Single-shift production with one CNC machine. With two machines, the time is cut in half. </p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/products/presetting-measuring/vertical-devices/smile\">Learn more about »smile«</a></p>"
    },
    {
     "label": "Significant Increase in Revenue",
     "value": "$1 million",
     "text": "<p>ProCam, a family-owned business based in Michigan, USA, increased its revenue by $1 million within two years of purchasing a »smile 420«. Thanks to shorter setup times and less machine downtime, ProCam was able to process more orders.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/your-success/details?tx_news_pi1%5Bnews%5D=37&amp;cHash=992d0db4f33082f4543da88c75286a33\">Read the success story</a></p>"
    }
   ],
   "ftype": "zoller_content-scroller",
   "id": "c537",
