  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Greater Productivity in Milling, Turning, and Grinding </h2>",
   "body": "",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/2/csm_teaser_milling_6f80026943.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 377,
     "title": "Milling",
     "href": "/ca/milling",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Milling</h3> <p>Precise presetting &amp; measuring, the best balancing technology on the market, exact shrink-fitting and unshrink-fitting, as well as all interfaces and data for an end-to-end process from CAM to part. </p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/1/5/csm_teaser_turning_a68c271858.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 377,
     "title": "Rotate",
     "href": "/ca/rotate",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Rotate</h3> <p>Specialized measuring technology for turning tools, tool management, data handling, and efficient setup during non-productive time: ZOLLER helps you achieve greater success in turning.</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/6/f/csm_teaser_grinding_7de917acd6.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 377,
     "title": "Grinding",
     "href": "/ca/sharpening-tools",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Grinding</h3> <p>Interfaces with CAD design, data in controller format for the CNC grinding machine, simulated measurement runs, and in-process inspection and documentation.</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    }
   ],
