   "header": "<h2> \"Digitization using ZOLLER software systems played a key role in making our production significantly more cost-effective.\" </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">Frank Schaefer, Dipl.-Ing., Member of the Executive Board, LIDU Maschinenbau Lienenbrügger GmbH in Dülmen</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/your-success/details?tx_news_pi1%5Bnews%5D=112&amp;cHash=5bd9e00bf990db26ead5dc36b56cb9be\">Read the customer case study</a></p>",
